{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Just Grub 是一款把餐廳、咖啡店、酒吧、麵包店與美食車收藏到個人地圖的 App，適合經常尋找聚餐地點、想記錄口袋名單或與朋友共享美食清單的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-86.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自動整理專屬美食地圖</h2>\n<p>透過 Apple Maps 搜尋餐廳時，名稱、地址與類別會自動填入，亦可手動新增地點，收藏後以自訂圖釘顯示於地圖。用戶可標記已到訪或想去、給予五星評分、記錄價格等級，並用自由標籤與筆記整理。App 內建多種菜系及地點類型，支援篩選、排序、分享地點、共同清單、iCloud 同步與 JSON 匯出，毋須帳戶、沒有廣告及追蹤。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-326-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-327-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-328-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-329-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-330-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-331-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Just Grub</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/just-grub/id6787569798?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:18.053158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:57.375107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:19.615140+00:00","content_hash":"c1d599a5015a07cc2b2b47a3946a87022361a555b7c3535a387d020910b5ae91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}